Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,180)}{\an7}Principal's Office
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:06.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Tachibana-san, you're a pop idol, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:07.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,I think I've seen you on TV...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:11.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm a model, sir.\NI just got back from filming overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:13.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, my apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.71,0:00:17.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe a famous model like\Nyourself would come to our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:22.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's a good school, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:23.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Super old, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:24.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:29.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,I hate you and I hate manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:40.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,And I spotted the guy I hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:15.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(409.6,403.2)}{\an7}Cosplay Group Potential?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:17.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,M-Mikarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:20.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, it's Mikari Tachibana in the flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.58,0:02:21.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Her legs are so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:22.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,And she's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.71,0:02:25.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Like, inhumanly cute, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:28.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,M-Mikarin, could I get your autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Dude, what's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.29,0:02:32.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Of course! Anyone else want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:33.79,Q3,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:33.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.79,0:02:34.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.33,0:02:36.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.83,0:02:38.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Bet she's 'nice' to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.21,0:02:41.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Heard she's dating that male model Kei-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.92,0:02:43.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Lucky her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:47.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Not surprised. With her looks and body,\Nshe could have any guy she wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:50.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you guys have a manga club?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:52.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,A manga club? Anyone know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.71,0:02:55.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, you like manga? Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.71,0:02:58.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nope, I hate manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:06.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,It was an act of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:09.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Just an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:15.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Calm down, just act like it never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:15.83,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,108)}{\an7}Manga Club
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,I hope she's not here already...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:20.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:22.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:24.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is so awkward...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.96,0:03:26.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,I gotta break the silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:33.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,My heart's still racing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.67,0:03:35.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Am I still sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.46,0:03:43.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, sounded like something\Nbig went down this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:47.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, a new student joined our class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:49.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's some famous model.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.13,0:03:52.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,A model? Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:55.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's a model.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:59.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,A-and she's really cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:02.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wow, didn't think you cared about that kinda stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.46,0:04:08.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's got the perfect looks and body to\Ncosplay as Lilie's best friend, Miriella!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.25,0:04:11.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh. That's what you cared about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:15.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,I could make a legendary ROM if I got her to join me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:17.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.83,0:04:19.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,I found this in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:22.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that belongs to the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.79,0:04:25.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,I remember my senpai taking pictures with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.42,0:04:27.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Apparently, it's a good model!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:28.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,It turned on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:30.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,There are still pictures on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:32.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,These must be from the Culture Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:34.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Didn't know he was snapping pics here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.29,0:04:40.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:41.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:45.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,I keep making all these demands of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:48.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:52.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.63,0:04:55.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,What'll it be today? Anime? Video games?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:57.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Club's all about having fun together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:02.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:04.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Let's take some pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:12.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Last time was my first time taking cosplay pictures,\Nbut it was kinda fun, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:15.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,And you looked really...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Your cosplay looked really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:20.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:22.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm just so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:24.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,So those are happy tears?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.25,0:05:27.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I thought I was forcing you to\Ngo along with all my silly ideas...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.21,0:05:30.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,I was so worried you didn't want to do any of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:32.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do it if I didn't want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:35.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,So hearing you want to do it makes me super happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:36.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.67,0:05:39.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:41.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.79,0:05:47.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Teachers were inspecting bags today so\NI didn't bring my cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.50,0:05:49.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wow, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.67,0:05:51.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,We can take pictures another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai, come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:55.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:04.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, why this random classroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:06.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Cause no one's gonna come in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.25,0:06:09.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Let's take some practice shots in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.67,0:06:12.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,You mean, like, just in your uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:13.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.21,0:06:16.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,And this 50 mm fixed\Nlens should work for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:19.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,We'll just leave it in P-mode for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:21.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,What am I getting all worked up for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:24.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm just taking pictures of Ririsa.\NShe's not Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:34.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.67,0:06:37.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,I dunno, but I took a bunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:40.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,W-well?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:43.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,That bad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:44.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I look horrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:48.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry! The pictures are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:53.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I know we have to practice,\Nbut I just hate seeing pictures of myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,They look fine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:01.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm not Liliel,\Nand I wish I could be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:02.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:05.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,I know you wish I were 2D, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:11.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,I mean, school uniforms are all over the place in manga.\NThis is 2D enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:13.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're so smart, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:14.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:18.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,I see it now!\NI just need to pretend this uniform is cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:19.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:21.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:23.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Manga-length skirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:26.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Glasses, off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.17,0:07:28.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,A touch of makeup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:34.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,H-how about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:37.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Do I look like a manga character now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:46.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,T-this is Ririsa, remember?!\NShe's not Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:52.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's 3D, she's 3D, she's 3D...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:54.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is that helping him focus?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:58.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,But this pose is too normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:00.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,I should go for a sexy manga pose instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:11.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Whoa! No, her underwear's part of her costume!\NIt's totally normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:13.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is it, though?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.75,0:08:15.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Not good enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:19.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,The ecchi manga I like gets sexier than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:22.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,I gotta live up to its standards!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:30.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Where'd my glasses go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:32.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,The clumsy glasses girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:35.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's definitely a manga cliché!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.33,0:08:36.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Next up...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:37.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Owie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:38.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Maybe it wasn't acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:41.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:49.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I didn't mean to!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.58,0:08:50.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is perfect, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.67,0:08:51.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:54.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is the kind of fanservice\NI see all the time in shonen manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:08:59.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's actually getting this excited\Nabout acting out a sexy scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:01.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is what Ririsa likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:05.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Cosplay is insane...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:07.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.67,0:09:11.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at those pictures now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:12.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:15.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,They all came out pretty sexy,\Njust like you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:23.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,I forgot I wasn't wearing a cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:25.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:27.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,W-why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:30.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,These aren't costume panties,\Nthey're my actual panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:31.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,No looking, you perv!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.58,0:09:32.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.67,0:09:35.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,We got our practice,\Nso make sure you erase all those pictures!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:37.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, sheesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.75,0:09:44.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Class 1-1, Ririsa Amano,\Nplease come to the faculty office immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:46.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Think that's for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:49.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,I totally forgot I had mandatory tutoring!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:50.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be in so much trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:51.75,Q3,,0,0,0,,Her grades are already that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:51.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be in so much trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.75,0:09:52.71,Q3,,0,0,0,,Her grades are already that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.42,0:10:00.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Ririsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.38,0:10:03.25,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499.2,489.6)}{\an7}DELETE PHOTO?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.75,0:10:02.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Club's all about having fun together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:07.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,But I've gotta keep pictures of fun club activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.13,0:10:11.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's Mikarin doing in the club building?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:12.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is she gonna join a club?!\NWhich one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.83,0:10:13.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Can I get a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.83,0:10:16.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry, no pictures!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:17.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, I just said no pictures...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.38,0:10:22.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I need to get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:25.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry, let me through!\NPlease stop pushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.63,0:10:27.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Move, please!\NI need to get through here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:30.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.17,0:10:39.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.63,0:10:42.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Mikarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:51.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hanging out alone in here's just not as fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:55.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,How'd I have so much fun in here by myself before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:57.13,Q6,,0,0,0,,Mikarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.21,0:10:59.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:03.63,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,324)}{\an7}Manga Club
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.46,0:11:08.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Manga...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:13.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.96,0:11:17.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mikari?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:26.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,S...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:30.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:48.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:52.75,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,151.2)}{\an7}5 years earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:53.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okumura-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:12:00.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai, do you have a crush on anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.75,0:12:01.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,I sure do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:07.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with Liliel!\NShe'll never betray me, not ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:16.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,You stupid, weird otaku!\NI hate you and I hate manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:23.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's been too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:25.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Mikarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:27.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,I thought she came this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:28.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Mikarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:29.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Mikarin!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:31.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,I don't see her anywhere, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:36.21,Q6,,0,0,0,,Did you hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:36.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,W-what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:39.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you since we went\Nto different middle schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.71,0:12:43.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Mikarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.17,0:12:44.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Did she go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:47.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:49.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're the famous\Nmodel who just started today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.75,0:12:51.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm not that famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.71,0:12:53.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Thanks for rescuing me, though, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.08,0:12:56.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,There's one thing I still don't get.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:58.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why'd you hug me all of the sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.25,0:12:59.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.75,0:13:04.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,I was kinda hoping I'd make your heart skip a beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.75,0:13:05.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:10.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, why are you soaking wet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:14.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's a long story.\NCan I stay here till my clothes dry off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:16.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:26.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Even my bra is all wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.83,0:13:30.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is the super cute one I wore just for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:32.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wh- you can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:34.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sure you don't wanna see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.67,0:13:37.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,S-stop messing around and\Nput your stupid underwear on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:43.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm good.\NYou can turn around now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:48.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Whoops, maybe I wasn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.67,0:13:51.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,W-would you stop messing with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:56.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,What? It's not like I have a change of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:14:00.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm still tired from my late-night shoot yesterday,\Nso I'll take a nap while I wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:03.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine, but put some clothes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.21,0:14:09.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wanna join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:13.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's enough!\NWhy are you doing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:17.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Cause you never treated me like\Na cute girl when I was a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:19.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,and teasing you is really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:23.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Bet you think I'm cute now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:27.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,I dunno. You've always been cute, Mikari.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.17,0:14:27.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.96,0:14:32.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:34.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.33,0:14:36.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Everyone said she was cute back then, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:39.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Not like that! I'm different now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:46.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,I got way cuter, and way more fashionable,\Nand now I'm a famous model!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.46,0:14:50.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm not a little kid anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.08,0:14:57.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,The way you're fiddling with your pigtails...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.42,0:15:03.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're not that different.\NYou're still the little kid I played with back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:05.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,I am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:07.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're naked, you're naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.96,0:15:31.13,Q3,,0,0,0,,S-sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.96,0:15:31.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:34.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Don't go, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.33,0:15:38.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting forever to have you this close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:41.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,That took forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:43.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,I hope Senpai is still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:48.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Can we stay like this just a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.13,0:15:57.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,There's no way he doesn't get tempted now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.63,0:16:04.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, Senpai! I'm not... I'm not ready to go that far!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:02.71,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,72)}{\an7}You wanna do\N{\pos(115.2,122.4)}{\an7}it at school?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:08.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're gonna catch a cold like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.21,0:16:14.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,I stepped right on this doujin, too...\NForgive me, Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.79,0:16:22.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,He's a lost cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.25,0:16:27.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:30.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Do you have a crush on anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.13,0:16:32.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Like, a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:35.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:39.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:44.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with Liliel, of course!\NAnd I'll never cheat on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:50.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ririsa's face popped into my head,\Nbut that's only because I thought of her Liliel cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:53.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Which means everything is fine!\NNothing is wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.67,0:16:55.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Weirdo otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.79,0:16:58.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:06.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see you, but I still hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.21,0:17:07.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:15.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why was Mikari crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:21.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why can't I just tell him I like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:25.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,My life would be so much easier if I hated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:30.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I should've known he wouldn't change his\Nmind when he found out I was a supermodel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.17,0:17:32.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,You interested in showbiz?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.58,0:17:38.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,A girl with your figure could kill it as a model.\NYou could be the cutest one out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:41.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,If I got cuter, and got popular...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:47.00,Q6,,0,0,0,,Great! You're looking hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:47.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Then maybe Senpai will like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:49.08,Q9,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.71,0:17:56.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan, I heard you've got\Na crush on a boy at your school?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.79,0:17:58.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.17,0:18:01.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,But, he doesn't feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:02.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:04.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,He's just some random student, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:08.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,I mean, yeah.\NAnd he's a weird, creepy otaku, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.71,0:18:10.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,So why him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:14.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,When you get famous,\Nyou could be with an actor or a famous singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.21,0:18:16.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.00,0:18:19.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Forget about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:23.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Look at the wild caveman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.67,0:18:25.42,Q3,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.67,0:18:25.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,So much hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:26.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,So much hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.13,0:18:27.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's so weird and fluffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:29.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.08,0:18:37.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Lord Ashford commands you!\NGet your hands off my Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:43.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Eww, it's Yuckymura!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:45.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Run! You'll catch his nerd cooties!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:56.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's Liliel! She's from this manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.42,0:19:07.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(870.4,396)}{\an7}Children's Park
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:05.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wanna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:07.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why? Who are you, even?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.63,0:19:09.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,C'mon, lemme play.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:10.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:12.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Lord Ashford commands you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.21,0:19:14.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,I know that manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.71,0:19:28.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,You from around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.21,0:19:29.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:32.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Run, Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.42,0:19:35.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yes, Ashford-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.17,0:19:37.58,Q3,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.17,0:19:37.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yuckymura!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:47.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Everyone falls in love with me the second they see me,\Nbut not Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.13,0:19:50.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,He hasn't changed since the day I fell in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:55.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,I could've forgotten about him if he'd changed, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.92,0:19:58.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:01.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:05.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,If I betrayed him now,\NI'd be no better than the 3D girls he hates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:07.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh? 3D what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.96,0:20:13.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,He's been betrayed over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.75,0:20:15.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's why he's so devoted to Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.33,0:20:22.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,So I'm never going to betray him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.75,0:20:28.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,If he only trusts an angel,\Nthen I'll become that angel for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:32.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'll work hard so that one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:35.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,he turns towards me and finally\Nsays the words I want to hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:38.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,One day... One day...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.29,0:20:46.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him in years,\Nbut I'm still head over heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:50.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm a little relieved he hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:56.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,He's still the guy I love,\Nand no one's gonna take him from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.79,0:21:00.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,How am I gonna get through\Nto that stubborn otaku, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:06.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, Senpai! I can see him from here! Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.46,0:21:08.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Who's SHE?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.63,0:21:11.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.71,0:21:16.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Don't apologize, your timing was kinda perf...\NI mean, don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:17.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:19.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.83,0:21:22.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Then let's get back to taking pictures!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.17,0:21:25.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Can you stop randomly stripping?!\NAnd I thought you didn't have your cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.25,0:21:27.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,I remembered I brought a spare\Ncostume to school, just in case!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.38,0:21:29.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,In case what?!\NWhy would you ever need it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:34.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,My makeup's not perfect,\Nbut it'll work for some test shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:36.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it doesn't have to be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:38.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.88,0:21:48.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Se...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:54.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai, you liar!\NYou said you wouldn't cheat on Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:55.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,So what's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.54,0:21:57.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,And why are you blushing\Nlike that in front of her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.54,0:21:58.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:01.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai, do you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:02.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,You stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.67,0:22:05.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're in my class though, right, Tachibana-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.25,0:22:11.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Will you cosplay with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.25,0:22:13.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.67,0:22:25.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you Liliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:24:01.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,388.8)}{\an7}Lili x Miri
